# The vector store IS committed (data/chroma/), not ignored: hosts like Render's
# free tier have too little memory/build time to comfortably re-embed at deploy
# time, so the app loads this prebuilt index instead of rebuilding it at startup.
# Re-run `make ingest` and commit the result whenever data/corpus/ changes.
data/embeddings_dump.txt
# raw scraped pages are transient
data/raw/

